WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
An etrog has rules about defects and

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:05.420
reliable provenance. Learn its inspection carefully,

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.840
one skill at a time. Gradual learning

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.080
never excuses using an invalid specimen.
